Error [jet.MoveWithoutMarker]: `consume` takes `msg`, but `msg` is used again later
  --> tests/ui/ownership/unmarked_take_argument_reused_after_branch_teaches_copy.jet:11:17
    |
 11 |         consume(msg)
    |                 ^^^
  --> tests/ui/ownership/unmarked_take_argument_reused_after_branch_teaches_copy.jet:13:11
    |
 13 |     print(msg)
    |           ^^^ `msg` is used again here
 Why: `consume` takes ownership of this argument, and a call never copies on its own, so `msg` has no value after this call
 Fix: Write `msg.copy()` to pass a copy and keep `msg`, or reorder so this call is the last use of `msg`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
